      "summaries": {
        "en": "pi is an open-source AI agent toolkit that simplifies building and deploying coding agents. It provides a unified LLM API, a coding agent CLI, and libraries for TUI and web UIs, along with a Slack bot and vLLM pod support. Its key strength is the modular design, allowing developers to mix and match components like the CLI, UI libraries, and LLM backends. You can use pi to quickly create custom coding assistants, integrate AI into Slack workflows, or deploy scalable inference pods with vLLM.",
        "zh": "pi 是一个开源的 AI 智能体工具包，旨在简化编码智能体的构建与部署。它提供统一的 LLM API、编码智能体命令行界面、终端与 Web UI 库，以及 Slack 机器人和 vLLM 推理 pod 支持。其核心优势在于模块化设计，开发者可以灵活组合 CLI、UI 库和 LLM 后端等组件。你可以用 pi 快速搭建自定义编码助手，将 AI 集成到 Slack 工作流中，或利用 vLLM 部署可扩展的推理集群。",
        "es": "pi is an open-source AI agent toolkit that simplifies building and deploying coding agents. It provides a unified LLM API, a coding agent CLI, and libraries for TUI and web UIs, along with a Slack bot and vLLM pod support. Its key strength is the modular design, allowing developers to mix and match components like the CLI, UI libraries, and LLM backends. You can use pi to quickly create custom coding assistants, integrate AI into Slack workflows, or deploy scalable inference pods with vLLM.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "pi gives teams a dependable path to production-ready AI tooling.",
          "what": "pi is an open-source AI agent toolkit that simplifies building and deploying coding agents. It provides a unified LLM API, a coding agent CLI, and libraries for TUI and web UIs, along with a Slack bot and vLLM pod support. Its key strength is the modular design, allowing developers to mix and match components like the CLI, UI libraries, and LLM backends. You can use pi to quickly create custom coding assistants, integrate AI into Slack workflows, or deploy scalable inference pods with vLLM.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/earendil-works/pi for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
