      "summaries": {
        "en": "cmux is a macOS terminal built on Ghostty, designed to enhance AI coding agents like Claude Code and Codex. It adds vertical tabs and notifications, solving the problem of managing multiple agent sessions in a standard terminal. Technically, it leverages Ghostty's GPU-accelerated rendering for performance while extending its UI with custom tab management. Developers can use cmux to run multiple AI agents simultaneously, track their outputs via vertical tabs, and receive notifications on task completion, making it ideal for complex, multi-agent workflows.",
        "zh": "cmux 是一款基于 Ghostty 的 macOS 终端，专为 AI 编程代理（如 Claude Code、Codex）设计，通过垂直标签页和通知功能解决了多代理会话管理难题。其技术亮点在于利用 Ghostty 的 GPU 加速渲染保证性能，同时扩展了自定义标签管理界面。开发者可同时运行多个 AI 代理，通过垂直标签页追踪输出，并在任务完成时接收通知，非常适合复杂的多代理工作流。例如，你可以让一个代理编写代码，另一个代理审查，第三个代理运行测试，所有输出一目了然。",
        "es": "cmux is a macOS terminal built on Ghostty, designed to enhance AI coding agents like Claude Code and Codex. It adds vertical tabs and notifications, solving the problem of managing multiple agent sessions in a standard terminal. Technically, it leverages Ghostty's GPU-accelerated rendering for performance while extending its UI with custom tab management. Developers can use cmux to run multiple AI agents simultaneously, track their outputs via vertical tabs, and receive notifications on task completion, making it ideal for complex, multi-agent workflows.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "cmux stands out for amp, claude-code, and codex in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "cmux is a macOS terminal built on Ghostty, designed to enhance AI coding agents like Claude Code and Codex. It adds vertical tabs and notifications, solving the problem of managing multiple agent sessions in a standard terminal. Technically, it leverages Ghostty's GPU-accelerated rendering for performance while extending its UI with custom tab management. Developers can use cmux to run multiple AI agents simultaneously, track their outputs via vertical tabs, and receive notifications on task completion, making it ideal for complex, multi-agent workflows.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/manaflow-ai/cmux for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
