      "summaries": {
        "en": "This repository provides open-source plugins for knowledge workers to use within Claude Cowork, an AI-powered collaboration tool. The plugins extend Claude's capabilities for tasks like document analysis, data extraction, and workflow automation. Technically, they are modular Python scripts that interface with Claude via a plugin API, enabling custom tool integration. Developers can fork the repo, adapt existing plugins, or create new ones to automate repetitive knowledge work tasks, such as summarizing research papers or extracting structured data from reports.",
        "zh": "该仓库为知识工作者提供可在Claude Cowork中使用的开源插件，扩展AI协作工具能力。插件基于模块化Python脚本实现，通过Claude插件API进行交互，支持文档分析、数据提取与工作流自动化。技术亮点在于可扩展架构：开发者可复刻仓库，修改或创建插件以适配特定场景，如自动总结论文或提取结构化数据。这些插件降低了AI集成到知识工作流程的门槛，适合需定制化AI助手的团队或个人。",
        "es": "This repository provides open-source plugins for knowledge workers to use within Claude Cowork, an AI-powered collaboration tool. The plugins extend Claude's capabilities for tasks like document analysis, data extraction, and workflow automation. Technically, they are modular Python scripts that interface with Claude via a plugin API, enabling custom tool integration. Developers can fork the repo, adapt existing plugins, or create new ones to automate repetitive knowledge work tasks, such as summarizing research papers or extracting structured data from reports.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "knowledge-work-plugins gives teams a dependable path to production-ready AI tooling.",
          "what": "This repository provides open-source plugins for knowledge workers to use within Claude Cowork, an AI-powered collaboration tool. The plugins extend Claude's capabilities for tasks like document analysis, data extraction, and workflow automation. Technically, they are modular Python scripts that interface with Claude via a plugin API, enabling custom tool integration. Developers can fork the repo, adapt existing plugins, or create new ones to automate repetitive knowledge work tasks, such as summarizing research papers or extracting structured data from reports.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/anthropics/knowledge-work-plugins for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
